#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom/scripts.inc:1109
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom_Text_LegendHasReturnedDomeAceTucker"
msgid ""
"Ladies and gentlemen!\n"
"Boys, girls, and POKéMON!\p"
"Finally!\n"
"Finally, the legend has returned!\p"
"Yes, the name of that legend!\n"
"Our very own DOME ACE!\l"
"It's none other than TUCKER!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom/scripts.inc:1118
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom_Text_TuckerGoldIntro"
msgid ""
"TUCKER: Ah…\n"
"The pummeling roar of the crowd…\l"
"Their furnace-like heat of excitement…\l"
"This is a wonderful place…\p"
"To the crowd, I am the DOME ACE…\n"
"I represent their hopes and dreams…\l"
"I must never fade from their sight…\p"
"I must burn!\n"
"Brighter and more brilliant!\l"
"I must light all that gather here!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom/scripts.inc:1130
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom_Text_UnleashAllPowerIPossess"
msgid ""
"I will unleash all the power that\n"
"I possess! Right here and now!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom/scripts.inc:1134
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom_Text_NeverLostWhenPowerUnleashed"
msgid ""
"TUCKER: You're genuinely fantastic!\p"
"Never before! I haven't ever lost in the\n"
"times I've had to unleash my power.\p"
"Yes, quite fantastic!\n"
"Your FRONTIER PASS, please?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom/scripts.inc:1141
